    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Any Needles spell</p><p>Whenever the blue mage casts a Needles spell, it deals additional damage equal to the number of damage dice it rolls. In addition, the blue mage may choose a single natural weapon granted by Azure Physical Training. That weapon deals the same amount of additional damage on successful hits until the end of the blue mage's next turn.</p><p><em>* This talent adds effects to a blue mage's spellcasting ability. Only one of these talents can be applied to an individual spell and the decision must be made before the spell is cast.</em></p>",
